{"id":11299,"date":"2026-02-25T19:00:21","date_gmt":"2026-02-26T03:00:21","guid":{"rendered":"https://staging.kosick.com/?p=11299"},"modified":"2026-07-06T17:52:37","modified_gmt":"2026-07-07T00:52:37","slug":"blog-social-media-marketing","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https://staging.kosick.com/blog-social-media-marketing/","title":{"rendered":"Social Media for Golf Courses, Resorts, and Real Estate"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://staging.kosick.com/services/social-media-marketing/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"10744\">Social media</a> for golf courses, resorts, and real estate has become one of the most powerful growth tools in the premium categories. For golf courses, resorts, real estate, and hospitality brands, your social presence is no longer optional. It is often the first impression someone has before they book a tee time, plan a stay, or request a showing. People do not just want to see what you offer. They want to feel what it is like to be there.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Kosick Communications, we build social media marketing strategies for premium brands across Vancouver and Surrey and beyond. Our focus is simple. We capture content that makes people stop scrolling, tell your story in a way that matches your brand, and turn attention into action such as tee times, membership inquiries, direct bookings, and qualified real estate leads.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">Why premium brands win on social media</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In golf, hospitality, and real estate, perception is reality. A guest can decide whether your resort is worth the trip, whether your clubhouse feels like their community, or whether a property is worth viewing based on seconds of content. That is why the strongest social media marketing does not feel like advertising. It feels like access.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For golf courses, it is early morning light on the fairway, a clean tee shot sequence, the texture of the greens, and the energy on the patio after a round. For resorts, it is the full experience beyond the room, including dining, amenities, spa, views, and the moments people imagine living. For real estate, it is not only the layout and finishes. It is the lifestyle, the neighborhood, the natural light, and the details that justify premium value.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When social media is consistent and intentional, it builds familiarity and trust. That trust becomes bookings, inquiries, and sales.</p>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kb-btns11299_f5a95d-b0{gap:var(--global-kb-gap-xs, 0.5rem );justify-content:center;align-items:center;}.kt-btns11299_f5a95d-b0 .kt-button{font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}.kt-btns11299_f5a95d-b0 .kt-btn-wrap-0{margin-right:5px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_f5a95d-b0 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button{color:#555555;border-color:#555555;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_f5a95d-b0 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:hover, .wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_f5a95d-b0 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:focus{color:#ffffff;border-color:#444444;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_f5a95d-b0 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button::before{display:none;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_f5a95d-b0 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:hover, .wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_f5a95d-b0 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:focus{background:#444444;}</style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns11299_f5a95d-b0\"><style>ul.menu .wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn .kb-btn11299_4e6452-bb.kb-button{width:initial;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn .kb-btn11299_4e6452-bb.kb-button{text-transform:capitalize;border-top-left-radius:20px;border-top-right-radius:20px;border-bottom-right-radius:20px;border-bottom-left-radius:20px;}</style><a class=\"kb-button kt-button button kb-btn11299_4e6452-bb kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto kb-btn-global-fill kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-false wp-block-kadence-singlebtn\" href=\"https://staging.kosick.com/services/social-media-marketing/\"><span class=\"kt-btn-inner-text\">Social Media</span></a></div>\n\n\n<style>.kb-image11299_097047-ff.kb-image-is-ratio-size, .kb-image11299_097047-ff .kb-image-is-ratio-size{max-width:508px;width:100%;}.wp-block-kadence-column > .kt-inside-inner-col > .kb-image11299_097047-ff.kb-image-is-ratio-size, .wp-block-kadence-column > .kt-inside-inner-col > .kb-image11299_097047-ff .kb-image-is-ratio-size{align-self:unset;}.kb-image11299_097047-ff figure{max-width:508px;}.kb-image11299_097047-ff .image-is-svg, .kb-image11299_097047-ff .image-is-svg img{width:100%;}.kb-image11299_097047-ff .kb-image-has-overlay:after{opacity:0.3;}</style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-image kb-image11299_097047-ff\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3510\" height=\"1770\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/resort-marketing-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Helping businesses grow with marketing services in Canada, USA, and Mexico\" class=\"kb-img wp-image-1826\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/resort-marketing-scaled.jpg 3510w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/07/resort-marketing-360x182.jpg 360w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/07/resort-marketing-750x378.jpg 750w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/07/resort-marketing-1536x775.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/07/resort-marketing-2048x1033.jpg 2048w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/07/resort-marketing-1140x575.jpg 1140w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 3510px) 100vw, 3510px\" /></figure></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">How we capture content for golf courses and premium experiences</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Great social media marketing starts with great content. Our team captures content for golf courses, resorts, and premium hospitality experiences with a focus on storytelling, variety, and brand polish. We plan content that works across reels, stories, carousels, and paid ads so every shoot produces a library you can use for weeks, not days.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For golf courses, we capture course beauty shots, tee boxes, fairway movement, greens, practice facilities, food and beverage offerings, and lifestyle moments around the clubhouse. We also plan around tournaments, charity events, member events, and corporate days because those are natural engagement peaks and they create content people want to share.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For resorts and hospitality, we focus on what sells the stay. Arrival moments, room details, amenities, dining features, staff interactions, and seasonal experiences. We capture the atmosphere as much as the product, because the atmosphere is often what drives a booking decision.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For real estate, we capture more than a walkthrough. We highlight the craftsmanship, the lighting, the flow, and the lifestyle cues that make a home memorable. The goal is to create content that attracts serious buyers and supports agents with a premium digital presence that builds authority.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">What to post to drive leads, bookings, and sales</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Social media marketing performs best when it maps directly to your revenue drivers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For golf courses and clubs, content should support tee times but also highlight instruction, tournaments, food and beverage, and membership lifestyle. Membership decisions are rarely instant. Social media works by building confidence over time, then directing the prospect to a strong membership page or inquiry form.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For resorts, the goal is experience stacking. Show the stay, but also show the dining, amenities, spa, and what a weekend looks like from arrival to departure. This increases direct bookings and reduces reliance on third party booking platforms.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For real estate, a strong cadence of listing content, neighborhood highlights, and behind the scenes expertise drives both buyer interest and seller confidence. When your content looks premium and consistent, it positions you as the obvious choice to represent high value properties.</p>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kb-btns11299_811d45-8f{gap:var(--global-kb-gap-xs, 0.5rem );justify-content:center;align-items:center;}.kt-btns11299_811d45-8f .kt-button{font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}.kt-btns11299_811d45-8f .kt-btn-wrap-0{margin-right:5px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_811d45-8f .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button{color:#555555;border-color:#555555;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_811d45-8f .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:hover, .wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_811d45-8f .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:focus{color:#ffffff;border-color:#444444;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_811d45-8f .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button::before{display:none;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_811d45-8f .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:hover, .wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11299_811d45-8f .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:focus{background:#444444;}</style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns11299_811d45-8f\"><style>ul.menu .wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn .kb-btn11299_5e609d-62.kb-button{width:initial;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn .kb-btn11299_5e609d-62.kb-button{text-transform:capitalize;border-top-left-radius:20px;border-top-right-radius:20px;border-bottom-right-radius:20px;border-bottom-left-radius:20px;}</style><a class=\"kb-button kt-button button kb-btn11299_5e609d-62 kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto kb-btn-global-fill kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-false wp-block-kadence-singlebtn\" href=\"https://staging.kosick.com/contact/\"><span class=\"kt-btn-inner-text\">Connect With Us</span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">Vancouver and Surrey require premium execution</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Vancouver and Surrey are competitive markets with high expectations. Guests and buyers have options and they compare quickly. That is why premium brands here need social media marketing that reflects quality and consistency. Strong content paired with the right location signals, local tags, and community engagement drives local discovery. It also helps destination travelers and out of market buyers find you early in their planning process.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We often support organic posting with paid amplification so your best content reaches the right audience at the right time. Even modest budgets can produce strong results when the creative is strong and the targeting is correct.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">How Kosick Communications supports social media marketing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kosick Communications is a Vancouver based marketing agency with proven experience in premium categories including golf courses, resorts, hospitality, food and beverage, and real estate. We capture content on location, build a content engine that reflects your brand, and manage social media marketing strategies designed to drive real outcomes like tee times, membership inquiries, direct bookings, and qualified real estate leads.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you want social media marketing that looks premium, feels human, and performs, contact Kosick Communications. We will review your current social presence, identify quick wins, and build a strategy that helps your brand grow in Vancouver, Surrey, and beyond.</p>\n\n\n<style>.kb-row-layout-id11299_ab0092-f5 > .kt-row-column-wrap{align-content:start;}:where(.kb-row-layout-id11299_ab0092-f5 > .kt-row-column-wrap) > .wp-block-kadence-column{justify-content:start;}.kb-row-layout-id11299